### Page 1 of 2

```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

August 3, 2021
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #E-1-22 for furnishing Two (2) New 2021 4WD 72” Front-
Mount Mowers, for the City of Cheyenne, Community Recreation & Events
Department
______________________________________________
Three (3) bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.

The Three (3) Bids were received from:
1. Heartland Kubota.
Sheridan, Wyoming.
2. Stotz Equipment.
Evansville, Wyoming.
3. 4 Rivers Equipment.  Cheyenne, Wyoming

The bids were reviewed by Jason Sanchez (CRE), and Sam Payne (CRE).  Their recommendation
is to accept the lowest responsive bid from Heartland Kubota, for the purchase of Two (2) New
2021 4WD 72” Front-Mount Mowers, for the City of Cheyenne, Community Recreation and
Events Department.  The total cost for the Two (2) New 2021 4WD 72” Front-Mount Mowers,
less One (1) Trade In, is $78,580.00,

Funding:
022-26-2614-45-43102  (1% Sales Tax 15-18 / Equipment)

$39,165.00

030-17-1754-45-43416  (Spec Purpose Option Tax / Greenway Maintenance)

$39,415.00
Grand Total $78,580.00
```

